commit.files_modified:
- backend/main.py (add endpoints ~150 LOC):
  * POST /api/exams/start → {exam_id, started_at, time_limit_seconds, questions}
  * POST /api/exams/{exam_id}/submit(answers) → validates (now - started_at) <= 3600
    - If exceeded: return 403 EXAM_TIME_EXPIRED
    - Else: calculate score, return {score, breakdown_by_topic, weak_areas}
  * GET /api/exams/{exam_id}/time-remaining → {seconds_remaining}
- backend/database.py (add logic ~100 LOC):
  * calculate_score(answers, correct_answers): +4 for correct, -1 for wrong, 0 unanswered
  * detect_weak_areas(score_breakdown): accuracy < 60% → flag as weak

- backend/main.py (add endpoint ~100 LOC):
  * GET /api/dashboard/next-action → {action, topic, reason, est_time_min, priority}
  * GET /api/dashboard/readiness → {readiness_pct, final_score_est, weak_areas, days_to_exam}
- frontend/index.html (add ~250 LOC):
  * "Next Action" card: prominently displayed, shows action + reason, [Start Now] button
  * "Readiness" card: readiness %, progress bar, weak areas list, days to exam

